## Letterboxd lets you…

[Keep track of every film you’ve ever watched (or just start from the day you join)](https://letterboxd.com/welcome/#mark-watched) [Show some love for your favorite films, lists and reviews with a “like”](https://letterboxd.com/welcome/#mark-watched) [Write and share reviews, and follow friends and other members to read theirs](https://letterboxd.com/welcome/#logging-films) [Rate each film on a five-star scale (with halves) to record and share your reaction](https://letterboxd.com/welcome/#mark-watched) [Keep a diary of your film watching (and upgrade to **Pro** for comprehensive stats)](https://letterboxd.com/pro/) [Compile and share lists of films on any topic and keep a watchlist of films to see](https://letterboxd.com/welcome/#lists)

