### [Hashtag \#artificialintelligence: Cinematic Perspectives on AI](https://letterboxd.com/zurichfilmfest/story/hashtag-artificialintelligence-cinematic/)

Year after year, the Hashtag section highlights a trending social issue on social media that is shaping public discourse. This year, the 22nd Zurich Film Festival, which runs from September 24 to October 4, 2026, will focus on the pervasive topic of artificial intelligence. Highlights of the program include the highly anticipated documentary MUSK by Oscar-winning director Alex Gibney, as well as the powerful feature film SHEEP IN THE BOX by SHOPLIFTERS director Hirokazu Kore-eda.

